{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_ashlok_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_ashlok_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "決鬥",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ashlok_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d6f50f316cc67979de04bee39740a4a9043d923462cdc8a75af07d5fdec547cb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "比賽解說",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一記漂亮的突刺，伯雷斯瓦夫家的小少爺對昔日的同伴真是毫不留情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "比賽解說",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過保守的打法依舊無法抵禦轟鳴的火炮，灰毫騎士再次用重盾擋下攻擊，反手將對方逼到場地死角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "比賽解說",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位觀眾，欣賞熱血沸騰的騎士交鋒的同時，別忘了您還可以按下手邊的按鍵，為您支持的選手下注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "比賽解說",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在卡西米爾，一夜暴富不是夢想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格蕾納蒂，現在就是機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你站在我的對面，說明你已經做出了選擇。難道幾次交鋒之後，你就後悔了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就當作是滿足一位朋友提出的請求——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殺了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩週前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上啊！從他的肩甲和護肘之間的縫隙砍過去……漂亮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小點一聲，喬伊。你把大家的視線都吸引過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在酒吧裡看轉播為什麼還需要低調？我就是支持感染者打趴對面那群貴族！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃……你們知道我沒有指桑駡槐對吧，格蕾納蒂、阿貝特？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅格最近的勝率一直不錯，看來他在採訪中提到的“利用源石技藝轉變打法”並不是空話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反觀奧茲家的繼承人，他全身上下唯一值得稱讚的可能只有那雙贊助廠商提供的新型動力靴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "將軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不錯啊，沒想到每天看報紙真的有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……我認輸，格蕾納蒂。你看起來不是只有“小時候隨便下過幾局”的水準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有很多無所事事的親戚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不是你太想保下那枚騎士，你或許還有勝算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說，我們能不能做點酒吧裡該做的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們兩個用下棋來訓練戰術思維也不是一天兩天的事了。倒是你該反思一下，上一場淘汰賽到底為什麼被對手騙得團團轉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，這不公平，我又不像你們從小接受專業訓練。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是想在大騎士領租間小店，誰知道會在半路上感染？打比賽比較好賺，等湊齊資金我就光榮退役。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉打斷各位聊天，請問您是不是灰毫騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是《紅酒報》的記者，前幾天向您的臨時住所寄了採訪信，但似乎出了一點小問題……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我個人十分看好您在賽場上的表現，並認為您有足夠的實力晉級騎士錦標賽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想除了競技表現之外，觀眾們對於您私下的生活也會很感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "包括您常來的這家酒吧、您日常是如何訓練的，還有……卡利斯卡家族將您驅逐的始末。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的個人生活並沒有你想像的那麼精彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽聞您對家族心懷怨恨。比起爭奪希望渺茫的錦標賽冠軍，一篇登上頭條的新聞更能煽動騎士競技的觀眾，為您擴大影響力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟誰不喜歡聽故事，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以編撰那些天花亂墜的小道消息，我不在意。今天是休賽日，如果沒有其他問題，我想和朋友繼續下棋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧，打擾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我太感動了，小格蕾竟然為了我們拒絕《紅酒報》的採訪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不幸感染、家族決裂、獨赴大騎士領……炒作悲情戲碼比火炮轟鳴更容易獲得關注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些油墨紙張不是我們的競技場，喬伊。尋求捷徑會讓一名騎士失去最初珍視的那些東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿貝特說得對。我確實厭惡那些裝聾作啞的家族成員，但更討厭將自己的身分當作賣點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "《紅酒報》旗下的副刊最近推出了一個新專欄，專門採訪貴族出身的競技騎士，以此獲得各個家族的支持和資助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從歷史地位來說，我記得阿貝特的家族更崇高，那個記者怎麼不——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎喲！你幹什……咳，我是說沒認出你是他的損失，阿貝特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，幸好我沒被那些無良記者纏上。感謝高潔清廉的伯雷斯瓦夫家，雖然沒留下什麼家產，但為後輩省去了不少麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們繼續下棋吧，格蕾納蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "注意你的護甲，這個距離發射火炮可能會傷到自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對你來說遠距離作戰確實更具優勢，讓我想想我應該怎麼解決這個棘手的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對戰的時候你真的一句話都不說啊，格蕾納蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然如此……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的速度還是不夠快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的彈匣……空了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，既然無法解決，只能讓你的“老毛病”稍微發作一下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每次我都會慶幸自己的實力不足以和灰毫騎士對練，羅伯特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別打擾我們訓練。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇，就算是空包彈的威力也不小。看看棚戶區的圍牆，又快被轟碎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳，我會出加固費用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……等上週的比賽獎金到帳之後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種程度的破損只要用廢磚和合成膠就能修補。我家庭院抵押出去之前就是用這種方法修整的，花不了多少錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過開工前我們需要先接待一下這位被火炮聲吸引來的小客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "灰、灰毫騎士……只是想請問您可以幫我簽名嗎？……我看過您所有的比賽……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，大部分其實是聽收音機轉播……我不想打擾你們訓練，不然我還是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬伊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告訴我你的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戴安娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "簽好了，感謝你的支持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
