    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿貝特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我突然想起來，父母將家族交予我後，我還沒有邀請過任何朋友到伯雷斯瓦夫家做客。"
